	"notes": {
		"content": "## Session Goals\n- Validate split-view layout and interaction model\n- Keep chat and notes visible at the same time\n\n## Draft Decisions\n- JSON is the source of truth for personas/messages/notes\n- AI bot responses will be added later through an external API"
